Bundled viewer

The MIT License above covers Trellis's own code. From version 0.4.0 the
published package also bundles a compiled copy of Espalier
(`@taprootio/espalier`, proprietary) in `viewer/dist/`. That copy is not
under the MIT License: it is covered by `viewer/ESPALIER-GRANT.md`, with
Espalier's own license in `viewer/dist/ESPALIER-LICENSE.md` and its
third-party notices in `viewer/dist/licenses/`.
